      "poly": [
        113.24,
        171.76,
        530.46,
        171.76,
        530.46,
        205.4,
        113.24,
        205.4
      ],
      "text": "The undersigned is directed to say that with effect from the\n19th September, 1995 -",
      "html": null,
      "reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "text",
      "scope": "target",
      "order": 4,
      "poly": [
        147.55,
        210.2,
        533.34,
        210.2,
        533.34,
        292.84,
        147.55,
        292.84
      ],
      "text": "(i) Shri Eduardo Faleiro, Minister of State in the Ministry\nof Chemicals and Fertilisers, Minister of State in the\nMinistry of Parliamentary Affairs and Minister of State\nin the Departments of Electronics and Ocean\nDevelopment, relinquished the additional charge of the\noffice of the Minister of State in the Ministry of\nParliamentary Affairs.",
      "html": null,
      "reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "scope": "target",
      "order": 5,
      "poly": [
        143.23,
        289.96,
        535.26,
        289.96,
        535.26,
        362.02,
        143.23,
        362.02
      ],
      "text": "(ii) Smt. Krishna Sahi relinquished the office of the\nMinister of State in the Ministry of Civil Supplies,\nConsumer Affairs and Public Distribution and assumed\nthe office of the Minister of State in the Ministry of\nCivil Supplies, Consumer Affairs and Public\nDistribution (Department of Civil Supplies).",
      "html": null,
      "reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "scope": "target",
      "order": 6,
      "poly": [
        138.67,
        359.38,
        539.1,
        359.38,
        539.1,
        481.42,
        138.67,
        481.42
      ],
      "text": "(iii) Shri Mallikarjun, Minister of State in the Ministry of Defence, Minister of State in the Parliamentary Affairs and Minister of State in the Ministry of Railways, relinquished the office of the Minister of State in the Ministry of Defence and the additional charge of the office of the Minister of State in the Ministry of Railways and assumed the office of the Minister of State in the Ministry of Defence (Department of Defence). He will continue to hold the charge of the office of the Minister of State in the Ministry of Parliamentary Affairs.",
      "html": null,
      "reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "scope": "target",
      "order": 7,
      "poly": [
        148.75,
        477.57,
        541.26,
        477.57,
        541.26,
        540.51,
        148.75,
        540.51
      ],
      "text": "(iv) Shri S.S. Ahluwalia, Minister of State in the Ministry\nof Urban Affairs and Employment (Department of Urban\nEmployment and Poverty Alleviation), assumed the charge\nof the office, also, of the Minister of State in the\nMinistry of Parliamentary Affairs.",
      "html": null,
      "reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "scope": "target",
      "order": 8,
      "poly": [
        156.91,
        537.39,
        543.18,
        537.39,
        543.18,
        619.07,
        156.91,
        619.07
      ],
      "text": "(v) Shri Venod Sharma relinquished the office of the Minister of State in the Ministry of Civil Supplies, Consumer Affairs and Public Distribution and assumed the office of the Minister of State in the Ministry of Civil Supplies, Consumer Affairs and Public Distribution (Department of Consumer Affairs and Public Distribution System).",
      "html": null,
      "reason": null
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "scope": "target",
      "order": 9,
